  },
  "opioidMilestone7Description": "Seven days. Short-acting opioid withdrawal may be easing, while longer-acting drugs can take more time. Get help with symptoms and cravings.",
  "@opioidMilestone7Description": {
    "description": "Opioid milestone day 7 description"
  },
  "opioidMilestone14Title": "Two weeks, still going",
  "@opioidMilestone14Title": {
    "description": "Opioid milestone day 14 title"
  },
  "opioidMilestone14Description": "Two weeks into recovery. Sleep may still be unsettled, and that's common. You're doing real work, even when it doesn't feel dramatic.",
