  "pornographyReferenceDay1460": "Four Years: Durable Change\n\nSource: Ince et al., Compulsive sexual behavior disorder (CSBD) and problematic pornography use (PPU): a comprehensive, interdisciplinary, and expert-informed narrative review (2026).\n\nThe evidence base emphasizes heterogeneity and context and does not support a universal four-year point at which biological recovery is complete.\n\nFour years can still demonstrate deep maintenance. If the old pattern no longer dominates choices or disrupts relationships and functioning, those are substantive long-term outcomes.",
  "@pornographyReferenceDay1460": {
